<!-- Section — Professional Perspectives
     Staging-only addition (homepage). NOT a testimonial section — these
     are representative/illustrative professional perspectives, not
     claimed statements from named individuals. Avatars are inline SVG
     illustrations (no external images, no stock/AI face photos), kept
     small (36px) and clearly non-photorealistic per the approved spec.
     Sits between #pricing and the closing CTA banner; compact by design
     so it reads as a supporting element, not a standalone block. -->
